markedup_text = "Dig new shafts."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_avoy8")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_sdqv8")
markedup_result_text = "The workers dig new shafts, leaving the cliff face full of gaping holes.

Soon they find the local wells turning pale and gritty.

\"A curse from the cliff spirit,\" the priest declares."

